## Frequently asked questions

### Do you write compliant financial promotions?

No. I write and structure SEO content. Your compliance team decides what is approved for publication. I work to their edits and keep a record of each approval.

### Do I need a retainer after the audit?

No. You can implement the audit actions with your own team or web developer. The £495 is credited against your first month when a retainer starts within 60 days of delivery.

### How long does financial adviser SEO take?

Technical fixes can be in place within weeks of the audit. Local pack and content gains usually take several months. Competition in your area sets the pace.

My guide on [how long SEO takes](/blog/how-long-does-seo-take/) explains the main factors.

### Can you measure our share of AI answers against competitors?

Yes. The AI visibility audit checks agreed buyer questions across the available AI search tools. It benchmarks
 your firm against three agreed competitors. Results vary between runs. I report them as observed on the day.

